0..76 Comment "// Representation independence read at a theory\'s models: `Model(Toggle)` is"
77..156 Comment "// the bundled record its signature states — one type per sort, one value per"
157..234 Comment "// operation — so the toggles of `structure-operations.gandr` are models of"
235..312 Comment "// `Toggle`, and the path relating them as structures relates them as models."
314..376 Comment "// Negation, `not`, and the identity, `same`, on the booleans."
